  "description": "An emotional state of fear, anxiety, or despair, often associated with the anticipation of a difficult or unpleasant situation. In this meme, it is humorously expressed through the visual metaphor of a skull, symbolizing the universal feeling of dread experienced on Monday mornings when people are reluctant to return to work or routine after the weekend.",
